Drain-current spectrum varying kf
* Provenance: original Sansho R17 circuit with synthetic parameters.
* sweep: kf 0 1e-26 5e-26
.param probe=0
Vd d 0 0.95
Vg g 0 .83 ac 1
Ve e 0 0
Hread out 0 Vd 1k
Rload out 0 1k
M1 d g 0 e dev l=.48u w=2.4u
.model dev nmos(level=10 version=4.4 tox=4.6n tsi=75n tbox=105n nch=1.1e17 k1=.42 vth0=.48 u0=.047 fnoimod=0 kf={probe})
.noise v(out) Vg dec 5 1 10G
.end
